        <div class="wrap"><div class="col">
            <div class="eyebrow">Technology stack · Software &amp; AI</div>
            <h2>The intelligent side.</h2>
            <div class="cards">
                <div class="glass card"><div class="icon"><img src="/images/ai.jpg" alt=""></div>
