            <p>My CV covers my experience, roles and work history in detail. For work-related questions, get in touch directly.</p>
            <div class="cta">
                <a class="btn primary" href="/AnubhavKumarSingh_AI_MLE_CV.pdf" download>Download CV (PDF)</a>
